MID_SE_Seo_Naz_C: <EDH>
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_C_001: Om nom nom... *gulp* Ahaha!
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_C_002: Mmm, yep! Still got plenty of room. Better head to\nthe next spot.
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_C_003: Haha! You have quite the appetite. It is fitting that\nyou eat well, in order to be prepared for combat.
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_C_004: That's right! The more you eat, the stronger you get!
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_C_005: And it's great to have access to this much\namazing food.
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_C_006: Indeed. These sumptuous meals are only possible\nwhen a nation and its people thrive.
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_C_007: It is a queen's duty to sample the bounties of her\nland and enjoy them.
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_C_008: Heh, I bet as queen you get to eat so much\ngreat food.
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_C_009: Where I'm from, there was never enough food.
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_C_010: Sometimes we'd net a bird that flew in, but there\nwas never enough to go around.
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_C_011: When we got especially hungry, we'd eat bugs that\nwe'd trapped.
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_C_012: Oh. Bugs. Is this true?
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_C_013: Er, something wrong? You don't like bugs?
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_C_014: What you said...reminded me of something\nunpleasant.
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_C_015: There is a moth in the southern forests with wings\nlarge enough to cover a human face.
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_C_016: Oh, you don't like the big ones, huh? Yeah, maybe\nthe flavor on them isn't as good.
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_C_017: The flavor is not what concerns me.
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_C_018: I mean, I love 'em. They're loaded with protein, and\nthe ones that taste good taste really good.
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_C_019: You sound like one of my retainers. He is fond of\nstick bugs as a snack.
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_C_020: I bet I'd get along well with him! Maybe a taste for\nbugs runs in the family.
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_C_021: Haha. I will have my personal chef prepare some\nSaraminian cuisine for you someday.
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_C_022: Really? I bet it'll be sooo good. And probably just\nloaded with yummy, crunchy bugs!
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_C_023: Absolutely not. There is much more to our diet than\ncrawling vermin.
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_C_024: No bugs?! They're the best though...
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_B: <EDH>
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_B_001: Heyyy, you sure it's alright for a queen to go hunting\nwithout any guards?
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_B_002: Fear not. My soldiers are nearby, procuring their own\nfood as a form of recreation.
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_B_003: Besides, where is the fun in a chaperoned hunt?
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_B_004: Good point. I'm here because I'm just dying to fight\nsomething extra strong.
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_B_005: Heh. Perhaps we shall dine on our quarry. I did\nmake a promise to that effect once.
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_B_006: Oh, now I'm even more motivated! I better find\nsomething extra tasty...
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_B_007: Whoa!
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_B_008: A sandworm, here?! You OK with this, Theodora?
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_B_009: Ha! This is a golden opportunity.
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_B_010: Rarely am I able to challenge such a beast without\nmy soldiers "protecting" me.
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_B_011: The two of us shall slay it together. Are you\nprepared?
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_B_012: Ha! What a question! I'm way better equipped to\nfight a sandworm than you!
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_B_013: Rrrraaa-HYAH!
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_B_014: Phew! Well, that was something. We did it, just\nus two.
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_B_015: Excellent work on your part. Though I could easily\nhave handled it on my own.
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_B_016: You think so? But don't you hate big bugs?
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_B_017: Not ones of this size. They are merely another kind\nof Demonic Beast to slaughter.
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_B_018: Gotcha. So sandworms are no problem for you.\nThey're more than just big too—they're super tasty!
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_B_019: *gasp* You... You eat them?
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_B_020: I mean, isn't that why we hunted it? You can have a\nwhole week's worth of meals off a single sandworm!
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_B_021: They're loaded with meat. And you can use every bit\nof 'em to make other things too.
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_B_022: Come now. I fought to repel a threat, not to secure\na meal...
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_B_023: I'm pumped for dinner tonight! It's gonna be\namazing, made by your personal chef!
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_B_024: Y-yes... I shall see to it that they employ the full\nextent of their talents.
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_A: <EDH>
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_A_001: What a meal! Today's food was extra tasty.
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_A_002: Saraminian chefs are second to none. You ought to\nseek them out to thank them.
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_A_003: Sure will! Gah, remember that one time they made\nthe sandworm cuisine? That was sooo good.
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_A_004: So it was. The flavor was surprisingly similar\nto seafood.
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_A_005: Haha. Told ya it'd be tasty! Nothing beats a\nwell-cooked sandworm.
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_A_006: But I remember you were still pretty hesitant until\nyou finally took a bite.
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_A_007: Ugh. Let us not speak of it. I admit my error—is that\nnot enough?
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_A_008: I would rather you not trumpet from the rooftops\nhow the queen of Saramis once ate an insect.
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_A_009: Nah, that's not my style. I don't go around blabbing\nabout things.
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_A_010: If you want it kept secret, I'll take it to the grave.
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_A_011: I appreciate your discretion.
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_A_012: There really aren't many people who can stuff their\nfaces like they used to be able to...
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_A_013: Food's so hard to come by now because of the war.
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_A_014: You speak as though it is no concern of yours.
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_A_015: This hardship will continue until we achieve victory.\nUntil then, life will be hardest for ordinary folk.
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_A_016: Provisions for armies do not grow on trees. They\ncome from the larger populace.
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_A_017: We warriors are prioritized because of our duty to\nthem. It is we who keep them safe.
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_A_018: Whatever threats a nation may face, it is understood\nthat the soldiers will be there to meet it.
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_A_019: So the food we just ate—we're fortunate to have\neaten it. Really, it was a gift given to us.
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_A_020: Indeed. The people surrender it gladly in hopes of\nsurvival. But the same is true in peacetime.
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_A_021: A queen who samples the bounties of the land\ndoes so knowing her own responsibilities.
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_A_022: That makes sense. Back home, we had to ration and\nshare what little food we had.
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_A_023: Even though we've got the support of a lot of people,\nthey're asking us to fight for them. To live for them.
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_A_024: And so they share their food with us.
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_A_025: Our meal and our conversation are over now, Nezha.\nThe dessert of battle awaits us.
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_A_026: Good call. I've got the hopes of the people safely in\nmy stomach. Let's go!
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_A_027: Hehe. Once we win the war, I shall invite you to\nmy royal palace.
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_A_028: The people and I will hold a feast in honor of your\ndeeds and your voracious appetite.
MID_SE_Seo_Naz_A_029: Oh yeahhh! I can't wait for that.